      "solution": "Khoảng biến thiên của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>181</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>161</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Nhóm có tần số lớn nhất là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>165</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>169</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> với tần số <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>13</mn></semantics></math>.<br/>Cỡ mẫu <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Số trung bình của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">¯</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>163</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>167</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>171</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>175</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>179</mn></mrow><mn>40</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>170</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Phương sai của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>163</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>170</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>167</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>170</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>171</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>170</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>175</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>170</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>179</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>170</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>40</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>23</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Độ lệch chuẩn của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mn>23</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>86</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Cỡ mẫu <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Tứ phân vị thứ nhất thuộc nhóm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>165</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>169</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>165</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mn>13</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mn>166</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Tứ phân vị thứ hai (trung vị) thuộc nhóm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>169</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>173</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>169</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>169</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Tứ phân vị thứ ba thuộc nhóm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>173</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>177</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>173</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>28</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mn>174</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Khoảng tứ phân vị của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.",
